Build Environment:
------------------
- Ubuntu 24.04 64-bit

Changes:
--------

New Features:
-------------
- Add support for imx8mp-phyflex-phyvip-1
  Supported phyFLEX-SoM:
    * EEPROM
    * eMMC
    * Ethernet
    * GPIOs
    * GPU/VPU
    * PMIC
    * RTC
  Supported phyVIP platform:
    * EEPROM
    * PCIe AI accelerator (Hailo-8)
    * SD-card
    * TPM2.0
    * Thermal sensors
    * UART (Console)
    * WiFi
    * Cameras (VM016, VM017, VM020, VM024)
  Supported PEB-B-006 interfaces:
    * Audio
    * CAN
    * EEPROM
    * HDMI
    * ON/OFF button
    * RS485
    * USB
- Add PEB-WLBT-07 support for phyboard-pollux
- Add NPU support on phyboard-pollux
- Add support for pca9632 on phyboard-pollux

Issues fixed:
-------------
- Fixed LED support on phyboard-pollux
- Fixed Audio support for phyboard-pollux
- 4GiB RAM Timings on phyFLEX Libra fully validated

Defeatured:
-----------

Known Issues/Limitations:
-------------------------
- No support for 8GiB RAM variant
- no EFI support
- No USB-C support for phyFLEX Libra
- phyboard-pollux-imx8mp-3: Upper USB port on X5 connector doesn't
  work reliable in host mode in bootloader
- shutdown from Linux might sometimes take longer due to systemd stop job running
- Reduction of CMA size to half for phyBOARD Pollux 1GiB RAM SoM
- Increased resume duration during suspend to RAM
